---
import MainLayout from '@layouts/page.astro';
---

<MainLayout>
  <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Yeoford Hall Calendar</h1>

  <p>
    Since opening in March the hall is being used by more and more people, and
    we now have regular fitness and pilates to add to the regular daytime
    groups. The hall offers a smaller meeting room in addition to the main
    space, a fully equipped kitchen, home and away changing rooms, toilet
    facilities and a car park.
  </p>

  <div class="aspect-[4/3] w-full md:aspect-[16/9]">
    <iframe
      frameborder="0"
      height="100%"
      scrolling="no"
      src="https://www.google.com/calendar/embed?title=Yeoford%20Hall&showTz=0&height=600&wkst=2&bgcolor=%23FFFFFF&src=yeoford.hall@gmail.com&color=%2329527A&ctz=Europe%2FLondon"
      style="border: 0"
      title="Yeoford Hall Calendar"
      width="100%"></iframe>
  </div>

  <h2 class="mt-12 mb-6 text-2xl font-bold">Booking the hall</h2>

  <p>
    To book the hall, please contact the hall manager, <a
      class="text-blue-500 underline"
      href="mailto:yeoford.hall@gmail.com">yeoford.hall@gmail.com</a
    >.
  </p>

  <table class="my-8 w-3/4 border-collapse">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th
          class="border border-gray-300 bg-blue-100 p-4 text-xl font-bold"
          colspan="5">Community Hall charges</th
        >
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3"></th>
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3"
          >Trustee User Groups</th
        >
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3"
          >Local community groups</th
        >
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3"
          >Private bookings (local)</th
        >
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3"
          >Private bookings (Non-local)</th
        >
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3 text-left"
          >Main Hall (includes kitchen)</th
        >
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£3.00</td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£5.00</td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£8.00</td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£10.00</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3 text-left"
          >Meeting Room (includes kitchen)</th
        >
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£2.00</td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£3.00</td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£3.50</td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£5.50</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3 text-left"
          >Party/wedding (24hr hire)</th
        >
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center"> - </td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center"> - </td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£150</td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£250</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3 text-left"
          >Party/wedding (48hr hire)</th
        >
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center"> - </td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center"> - </td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£400</td>
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center">£500</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-3 text-left"
          >Changing rooms</th
        >
        <td class="border border-gray-300 p-3 text-center" colspan="4"
          >Free of charge with the booking of the playing field, but by
          arrangement for any other time</td
        >
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
  }
</style>
